{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "inbound/a-turn-takes-its-binding-s-reasoning-effort",
  "title": "An agent's turn asks for the reasoning effort its binding's metadata sets, over the agent's own, none included; a null effort there, or no key, keeps the agent's",
  "rules": [
    "§6.4",
    "§6.7",
    "Appendix A.9"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: channels/_ai_context.py _turn_settings, _turn_source (binding metadata, then the config provider's result, then the channel default; None is not set at every level, an explicit null included); tests/test_channels/test_turn_config.py TestReasoningOverrides::test_channel_default_reaches_context, test_binding_metadata_wins_over_turn_config (its binding half), TestANullDefers::test_a_binding_null_keeps_the_channel_default[reasoning_effort]. The agent's effort is low; room-1 binds it with high, room-2 with null, room-3 with no metadata, room-4 with none, which states reasoning off for that room (Appendix A.9).",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "main",
        "type": "ai",
        "reasoning_effort": "low",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "ok"
            },
            {
              "text": "ok"
            },
            {
              "text": "ok"
            },
            {
              "text": "ok"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "room-1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "main",
            "category": "intelligence",
            "metadata": {
              "reasoning_effort": "high"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "room-2",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "main",
            "category": "intelligence",
            "metadata": {
              "reasoning_effort": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "room-3",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "main",
            "category": "intelligence"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "room-4",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "main",
            "category": "intelligence",
            "metadata": {
              "reasoning_effort": "none"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "+15551234567",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "hi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-2",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "+15551234567",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "hi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-3",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "+15551234567",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "hi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-4",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "+15551234567",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "hi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "models": {
      "main": [
        {
          "reasoning_effort": "high"
        },
        {
          "reasoning_effort": "low"
        },
        {
          "reasoning_effort": "low"
        },
        {
          "reasoning_effort": "none"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
